<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="442315935"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1537736096"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Welcome to the *fam"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="EGOIST"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Welcome to the *fam"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:48.976"><div begin="00:07.003" end="03:49.316"><p begin="00:07.003" end="00:07.569" itunes:key="L86052">Hey yo<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全世界 看过来 我就是EGOIST</span></p><p begin="00:07.579" end="00:09.459" itunes:key="L86053">Voila, world. This is EGOIST</p><p begin="00:09.469" end="00:11.030" itunes:key="L86054">They call me a catalyst<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们都说我是个有感染力的人</span></p><p begin="00:11.040" end="00:14.379" itunes:key="L86055">ヒーローのように現れちゃうアーティスト<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如英雄一般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi i ro o no yo u ni</span></p><p begin="00:13.380" end="00:16.588" itunes:key="L86056">Selamat datang (Yeah) ยนิ ดตี อ้ นรบั (Oh)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现身于此的艺人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ra wa re cha u a a ti su to</span></p><p begin="00:16.598" end="00:21.567" itunes:key="L86057">歓迎光臨 (Ah) ようこそ to the fam<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">欢迎光临（泰语）</span></p><p begin="00:21.681" end="00:24.097" itunes:key="L86058">Selamat datang (Yeah)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">欢迎光临</span></p><p begin="00:22.975" end="00:26.922" itunes:key="L86059">歓迎光臨 (Ah) Welcome to the fam<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">欢迎光临</span></p><p begin="00:26.924" end="00:27.617" itunes:key="L86060">ハーイ greeting<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">轻轻挥挥手为你们献上我的问候</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha a i greeting</span></p><p begin="00:27.627" end="00:30.174" itunes:key="L86061">Handshaking phoneに着信 friends 100人<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看一看电话收到一百条好友申请</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha a i greeting</span></p><p begin="00:30.184" end="00:31.735" itunes:key="L86062">ってチューインガムでパッチン<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">吹爆口香糖吓你们一跳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">'t te chu u i n ga mu de pa 'c chi n</span></p><p begin="00:31.745" end="00:33.291" itunes:key="L86063">ヘイご友人どこの出身?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">hey朋友你来自哪里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">he i go yu u ji n do ko no shu 's shi n ？</span></p><p begin="00:33.501" end="00:34.790" itunes:key="L86064">あ そう 私 from Tokyo<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 是嘛 我来自东京</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">he i go yu u ji n do ko no shu 's shi n ？</span></p><p begin="00:34.800" end="00:36.539" itunes:key="L86065">マリオでカート フラッグ countdown<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">马里奥赛车 赛结旗开始倒计时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a so u wa ta shi from Tokyo</span></p><p begin="00:36.649" end="00:37.975" itunes:key="L86066">ロケットダッシュスタート<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">火箭发射拉开序幕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ro ke 't to da 's shu su ta a to</span></p><p begin="00:37.985" end="00:39.697" itunes:key="L86067">Make ゴースト ニューレコード<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将创造震惊全世界的新纪录</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Make go o su to nyu u re ko o do</span></p><p begin="00:39.707" end="00:41.493" itunes:key="L86068">Look at me もっと zoom up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看着我吧我的分数将直线飙升</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Look at me mo 't to zoom up</span></p><p begin="00:41.503" end="00:43.093" itunes:key="L86069">隠しコマンドで warm up<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在让我用隐藏指令热个身先</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ku shi ko ma n do de warm up</span></p><p begin="00:43.403" end="00:46.329" itunes:key="L86070">↑X↓B L Y R A いっちょやってみっか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">（七龙珠-超武斗传2的隐藏指令）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i 'c cho ya 't te mi 'k ka</span></p><p begin="00:46.339" end="00:47.722" itunes:key="L86071">孫悟空も登場<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">孙悟空也开始登场了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so n go ku u mo to u jo u</span></p><p begin="00:47.732" end="00:48.890" itunes:key="L86072">1コンまじ暴走<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">死了一条命 真是叫人抓狂（※1コン：游戏用语，指使用道具复活继续游戏）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa n ko n ma ji bo u so u</span></p><p begin="00:48.900" end="00:49.763" itunes:key="L86073">メテオスマッシュ No<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不会吧 居然给我来陨石冲击</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me te o su ma 's shu no</span></p><p begin="00:49.773" end="00:50.688" itunes:key="L86074">回避は不能<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再来一场真实的比赛吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me te o su ma 's shu no</span></p><p begin="00:50.798" end="00:52.580" itunes:key="L86075">始まっちゃうからリアルファイト<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">根本就躲不过啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka i hi wa fu no u</span></p><p begin="00:51.390" end="00:54.150" itunes:key="L86076">Voila, world. This is EGOIST<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真正的战斗开始了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka i hi wa fu no u</span></p><p begin="00:54.160" end="00:57.177" itunes:key="L86077">まるで virtual な artist<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全世界 看过来 我就是EGOIST</span></p><p begin="00:57.587" end="01:02.100" itunes:key="L86078">どんな困難な展開だって打破してく名プレイ魅せちゃう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论有多少困难 在我面前都会迎刃而解</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ru de virtual na artist</span></p><p begin="01:02.110" end="01:05.220" itunes:key="L86079">ゲージは MAX I'm ready ぶっぱ killer blow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让你们看看什么才是游戏的大神</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me i pu re i mi se cha u</span></p><p begin="01:04.230" end="01:06.999" itunes:key="L86080">Voila, world. This is EGOIST<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能量满槽 我已准备好给你致命的一击</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ge e ji wa MAX I'm ready bu 'p pa killer blow</span></p><p begin="01:07.009" end="01:09.942" itunes:key="L86081">Here comes a new challenger<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一位新的挑战者登场</span></p><p begin="01:10.152" end="01:14.804" itunes:key="L86082">どんな劣勢な状況だってひっくり返す名プレイ魅せちゃう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算现在处于劣势</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na re 's se i na jo u kyo u da 't te</span></p><p begin="01:14.814" end="01:21.189" itunes:key="L86083">ゲージは MAX I'm ready ぶっぱ killer blow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能量满槽 我已准备好给你致命的一击</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ge e ji wa MAX I'm ready bu 'p pa killer blow</span></p><p begin="01:21.699" end="01:24.658" itunes:key="L86084">Kick! Punch! It's up to your mind<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">拳打还是脚踢 由你来决定</span></p><p begin="01:24.668" end="01:26.254" itunes:key="L86085">タマネギ先生 free な mic<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洋葱老师 自由的麦克风（※出自音游名作《动感小子2》）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta ma ne gi se n se i free na mic</span></p><p begin="01:26.264" end="01:27.674" itunes:key="L86086">サニーちゃん cute な smile<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">sunny酱 笑容真可爱（※同上）</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa ni i cha n cute na smile</span></p><p begin="01:27.684" end="01:29.502" itunes:key="L86087">クールなくらい決めてくスタイル<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">冷酷地决定自己的风格</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku u ru na ku ra i ki me te ku su ta i ru</span></p><p begin="01:29.512" end="01:31.032" itunes:key="L86088">このまま続けてくぜ rhyme<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让节奏就这样继续下去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ma ma tsu zu ke te ku ze rhyme</span></p><p begin="01:31.342" end="01:32.479" itunes:key="L86089">Hey yo play music<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">播放音乐</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">pu re su te shi na ga ra ki ku favorite</span></p><p begin="01:32.489" end="01:34.142" itunes:key="L86090">プレステしながら聴く favorite<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">边玩PlayStation边听歌是我最爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">pu re su te shi na ga ra ki ku favorite</span></p><p begin="01:34.152" end="01:35.609" itunes:key="L86091">BGM も God エースコンバット<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">BGM也是 我的天 就像是皇牌空战一样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">BGM mo god e e su ko n ba 't to</span></p><p begin="01:35.619" end="01:37.321" itunes:key="L86092">次こそ mission accomplished<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">下次一定要完成任务</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">BGM mo god e e su ko n ba 't to</span></p><p begin="01:37.331" end="01:39.098" itunes:key="L86093">ロックマンクリアーできない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">洛克人总是不能通关</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ro 'k ku ma n ku ri a a de ki na i</span></p><p begin="01:39.108" end="01:40.645" itunes:key="L86094">無理エアーマン倒せない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不行 空气人太难打了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ri e a a ma n ta o se na i</span></p><p begin="01:40.655" end="01:43.797" itunes:key="L86095">Is it just me? OMG... もう何回目のプレイ?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只有我一个这样吗 我天 都已经刷第几次了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Is it just me OMG mo u na n ka i me no pu re i ？</span></p><p begin="01:43.807" end="01:45.332" itunes:key="L86096">シビアすぎるドット単位<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这像素单位也太苛刻了吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi bi a su gi ru do 't to ta n i</span></p><p begin="01:45.342" end="01:46.964" itunes:key="L86097">ぐっと堪えなきゃ短気<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我得有点耐心沉住气才行</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">gu 't to ko ra e na kya ta n ki</span></p><p begin="01:46.974" end="01:48.482" itunes:key="L86098">ってビデオ端子 壊れてるし<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">话说接线端口都坏掉了啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">'t te bi de o ta n shi ko wa re te ru shi</span></p><p begin="01:48.492" end="01:50.095" itunes:key="L86099">2コンに叫ぶ fxxk you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我都死两次了 f**k you</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu u ko n ni sa ke bu fuck you</span></p><p begin="01:48.924" end="01:51.677" itunes:key="L86100">Voila, world. This is EGOIST<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu u ko n ni sa ke bu fuck you</span></p><p begin="01:51.687" end="01:55.174" itunes:key="L86101">まるで virtual な artist<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全世界 看过来 我就是EGOIST</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ru de virtual na artist</span></p><p begin="01:55.184" end="01:59.447" itunes:key="L86102">どんな困難な展開だって打破してく名プレイ魅せちゃう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论有多难通关我都会一一打破</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na ko n na n na te n ka i da 't te da ha shi te ku</span></p><p begin="01:59.657" end="02:02.744" itunes:key="L86103">ゲージは MAX I'm ready ぶっぱ killer blow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让你们看看什么才是游戏的大神</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ge e ji wa MAX I'm ready bu 'p pa killer blow</span></p><p begin="02:02.054" end="02:04.262" itunes:key="L86104">Voila, world. This is EGOIST<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全世界 看过来 我就是EGOIST</span></p><p begin="02:04.672" end="02:07.550" itunes:key="L86105">Here comes a new challenger yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一位新的挑战者登场</span></p><p begin="02:07.960" end="02:12.395" itunes:key="L86106">どんな劣勢な状況だってひっくり返す名プレイ魅せちゃう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算现在处于劣势</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na re 's se i na jo u kyo u da 't te</span></p><p begin="02:12.405" end="02:18.986" itunes:key="L86107">ゲージはMAX I'm readyぶっぱkiller blow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能量满槽 我已准备好给你致命的一击</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ge e ji wa MAX I'm ready bu 'p pa killer blow</span></p><p begin="02:18.996" end="02:21.631" itunes:key="L86108">I am a goddess who holds the key to the world<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我就是主宰世界的女神</span></p><p begin="02:21.641" end="02:24.983" itunes:key="L86109">たった一人この世界で成し得る<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只有我一人能征服世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta 't ta hi to ri ko no se ka i de na shi e ru</span></p><p begin="02:25.393" end="02:28.118" itunes:key="L86110">When my finger moves you're a dead man<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我动一动手指就能置你于死地</span></p><p begin="02:28.128" end="02:31.900" itunes:key="L86111">1 frame で入れる最速コマンド Let's go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一帧输入最快指令 上吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa n frame de i re ru sa i so ku ko ma n do let's go</span></p><p begin="02:31.910" end="02:33.493" itunes:key="L86112">Nonstop まだまだまだ行くぜ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在还不能停下来 还早着呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Nonstop ma da ma da ma da i ku ze</span></p><p begin="02:33.503" end="02:35.008" itunes:key="L86113">実行型 EGOIST.exe<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">点击一下就能扩散到每个角落</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ji 'k ko u ka ta EGOIST.exe</span></p><p begin="02:35.018" end="02:36.706" itunes:key="L86114">クリック拡散してく everywhere<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">轻轻点击一下就能传播到世界各地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ku ri 'k ku ka ku sa n shi te ku everywhere</span></p><p begin="02:36.716" end="02:38.334" itunes:key="L86115">My コスプレ画像だらけだぜ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">到处都是我的cos图</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">My ko su pu re ga zo u da ra ke da ze</span></p><p begin="02:38.344" end="02:39.809" itunes:key="L86116">I'm from noitaminA<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我来自noitaminA</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">My ko su pu re ga zo u da ra ke da ze</span></p><p begin="02:39.819" end="02:40.999" itunes:key="L86117">You チェックしてみな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你去网上搜一搜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">You che 'k ku shi te mi na</span></p><p begin="02:41.009" end="02:42.752" itunes:key="L86118">この Asia から America<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从亚洲到美国</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no Asia ka ra America</span></p><p begin="02:42.762" end="02:44.436" itunes:key="L86119">繋がる二次元エリア say<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连接起二次元的领域</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu na ga ru ni ji ge n e ri a say</span></p><p begin="02:44.446" end="02:47.648" itunes:key="L86120">Ho (Ho) say<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu na ga ru ni ji ge n e ri a say</span></p><p begin="02:47.658" end="02:50.423" itunes:key="L86121">Ho ho ho (Ho ho ho)</p><p begin="02:50.786" end="02:54.039" itunes:key="L86123">Ho (Ho) say</p><p begin="02:54.049" end="02:57.214" itunes:key="L86124">Ho ho ho (Ho ho ho)</p><p begin="02:56.624" end="02:57.513" itunes:key="L86125">Here we go now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们现在开始</span></p><p begin="02:57.223" end="03:00.425" itunes:key="L86126">伝説のスペースインベーダーな game<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">传说中名为太空侵略者的游戏</span></p><p begin="03:00.192" end="03:03.427" itunes:key="L86127">速攻100円入れて準備OK<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">传说中的太空侵入者这款游戏</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de n se tsu no su pe e su i n be e da a na game</span></p><p begin="03:03.537" end="03:06.544" itunes:key="L86128">ミサイル避けマジ狙ってけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">小心避开导弹眼睛真的要瞄准一点</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi sa i ru sa ke ma ji ne ra 't te ke</span></p><p begin="03:06.554" end="03:09.664" itunes:key="L86129">名古屋撃ちかっけえ 高得点get<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">名古屋射击 超帅 拿下高分</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na go ya u chi ka 'k ke e ko u to ku te n get</span></p><p begin="03:09.974" end="03:12.996" itunes:key="L86130">皆真似しちゃう super な game<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大家都争相模仿的良心游戏</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi n na ma ne shi cha u super na game</span></p><p begin="03:13.006" end="03:16.325" itunes:key="L86131">これぞ元祖 big respect しちゃうよ man<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">始祖就在这都来顶礼膜拜吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko re zo ga n so big respect shi cha u yo man</span></p><p begin="03:16.335" end="03:19.286" itunes:key="L86132">超絶タイト operability<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">天衣无缝的操作</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">cho u ze tsu ta i to operability</span></p><p begin="03:19.296" end="03:20.853" itunes:key="L86133">打ち落とせ enemy<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">吊打所有的敌人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u chi o to se enemy</span></p><p begin="03:20.863" end="03:22.801" itunes:key="L86134">Do you know what I mean?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你明白我的意思</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u chi o to se enemy</span></p><p begin="03:22.211" end="03:24.387" itunes:key="L86135">Voila, world. This is EGOIST<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全世界 看过来 我就是EGOIST</span></p><p begin="03:24.579" end="03:27.625" itunes:key="L86136">まるで virtual な artist yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">俨然是虚拟的艺人</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ru de virtual na artist</span></p><p begin="03:27.635" end="03:31.088" itunes:key="L86137">どんな困難な展開だって打破してく名プレイ魅せちゃう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无论有多难通关我都会一一打破</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na ko n na n na te n ka i da 't te da ha shi te ku</span></p><p begin="03:31.098" end="03:34.341" itunes:key="L86138">ゲージは MAX I'm ready ぶっぱ killer blow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让你们看看什么才是游戏的大神</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me i pu re i mi se cha u</span></p><p begin="03:34.783" end="03:37.481" itunes:key="L86139">Voila, world. This is EGOIST<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">全世界 看过来 我就是EGOIST</span></p><p begin="03:37.491" end="03:40.761" itunes:key="L86140">Here comes a new challenger yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一位新的挑战者登场</span></p><p begin="03:40.771" end="03:45.329" itunes:key="L86141">どんな劣勢な状況だってひっくり返す名プレイ魅せちゃう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算现在处于劣势</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do n na re 's se i na jo u kyo u da 't te</span></p><p begin="03:45.339" end="03:49.316" itunes:key="L86142">ゲージは MAX I'm ready ぶっぱ killer blow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">能量满槽 我已准备好给你致命的一击</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ge e ji wa MAX I'm ready bu 'p pa killer blow</span></p></div></body></tt>